    "detailed_description": "<strong>Sanity Bunker</strong> plunges you into a terrifying survival experience deep within a desolate underground bunker. As the sole remaining technician, your mission is to keep the facility running\u2014repair the failing pipes, revive the faltering generator, and ensure the systems don\u2019t collapse. But you\u2019re not alone. Something sinister haunts the bunker\u2019s dark, suffocating corridors, a malevolent force from a forgotten past. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180480/extras/9118619887eb57887eb9910ccc23860d.avif?t=1728540683\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br>Every step you take is a test of your sanity, as you teeter on the edge of madness and survival. Can you endure the nightmare and unearth the horrifying secrets buried within the bunker before it\u2019s too late?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180480/extras/57e2b332b73da2885d13c7b87713f3f6.avif?t=1728540683\" width=462 height=174 /></span>",
